Description: panvk: open a separate DRM file for each VkDevice before v10
 Panfrost ties its single GPU address space to the DRM file. Open the
 render node again for each VkDevice instead of duplicating the physical
 device fd, so that BOs of different devices do not share an address space.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
